OL,3,AUganda will now take part in Harry's
OL,4,AInvictus Games after King's reassurance
OL,5,
OL,6,FUganda's military leaders have
OL,7,Fconfirmed that they will take part in
OL,8,FPrince Harry's Invictus Games for
OL,9,Fwounded veterans after saying last week
OL,10,Fthey were going to pull out of the
OL,11,Fevent.
OL,13,FThey say the change of heart follows a
OL,14,Fphone call with the King's principal
OL,15,Fprivate secretary, Sir Clive Alderton,
OL,16,Fwho told them the King had "no problem"
OL,17,Fwith their participation in the games.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
