OL,3,AUganda will now take part in Harry's
OL,4,AInvictus Games after King's reassurance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis support from Buckingham Palace is
OL,7,Flikely to be seen as an olive branch to
OL,8,FPrince Harry, helping him with his
OL,9,Fsports events for injured service men
OL,10,Fand women.
OL,12,FIt had seemed that Uganda's involvement
OL,13,Fwas going to be a victim of a fall-out
OL,14,Fover a letter sent on behalf of the
OL,15,FKing clarifying that Prince Harry and
OL,16,FMeghan remained non-working royals.
